# Frontend rules

- React + Vite + TypeScript.
- Prefer shared primitives from `@agency/ui` over duplicating components.
- Use `@agency/shared` for types/constants used by more than one app.
- Keep route/page files focused; extract hooks and presentational pieces.
- Do not call Nest internals directly — go through the API / package clients.
